{"book":"Acts","chapter":27,"entries":[{"id":27856,"title":"Acts 27:1","segments":["¶And when it was determined that we should sail into Italy, they delivered Paul and certain other prisoners unto [one] named Julius, a centurion of Augustus' band."],"ref":"Acts 27:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶And","strong":"G1161"},{"text":" when","strong":"G5613"},{"text":" it was determined","strong":"G2919"},{"text":" that we","strong":"G2248"},{"text":" should sail","strong":"G636"},{"text":" into","strong":"G1519"},{"text":" Italy","strong":"G2482"},{"text":", they delivered","strong":"G3860"},{"text":"","strong":"G5037"},{"text":" Paul","strong":"G3972"},{"text":" and","strong":"G2532"},{"text":" certain","strong":"G5100"},{"text":" other","strong":"G2087"},{"text":" prisoners","strong":"G1202"},{"text":" unto [one] named","strong":"G3686"},{"text":" Julius","strong":"G2457"},{"text":", a centurion","strong":"G1543"},{"text":" of Augustus","strong":"G4575"},{"text":"' band","strong":"G4686"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":27857,"title":"Acts 27:2","segments":["And entering into a ship of Adramyttium, we launched, meaning to sail by the coasts of Asia; [one] Aristarchus, a Macedonian of Thessalonica, being with us."],"ref":"Acts 27:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And","strong":"G1161"},{"text":" entering","strong":"G1910"},{"text":" into a ship","strong":"G4143"},{"text":" of Adramyttium","strong":"G98"},{"text":", we launched","strong":"G321"},{"text":", meaning","strong":"G3195"},{"text":" to sail","strong":"G4126"},{"text":" by","strong":"G2596"},{"text":" the coasts","strong":"G5117"},{"text":" of Asia","strong":"G773"},{"text":"; [one] Aristarchus","strong":"G708"},{"text":", a Macedonian","strong":"G3110"},{"text":" of Thessalonica","strong":"G2331"},{"text":", being","strong":"G5607"},{"text":" with","strong":"G4862"},{"text":" us","strong":"G2254"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":27858,"title":"Acts 27:3","segments":["And the next [day] we touched at Sidon. And Julius courteously entreate